## Phase 4: Clustering & Insights (Week 5)

**Goal:** Reproducible clusters and insights that can be checked.

- **4.1 [FIX] Embedding text:** Combine Target, Clues, Search and a trimmed excerpt of the user's own sanitized words. **Do not include the Gap label**, so clusters are not just the gap categories. Embed locally with `all-MiniLM-L6-v2`. Flag non-English reviews via `language`; route them aside or use a multilingual model.
- **4.2 [FIX] UMAP + HDBSCAN:** Fixed `random_state`; `min_cluster_size` and `min_samples` in config; report the noise fraction (label -1). Try a few parameter settings and keep the one that is stable across seeds. Show noise as an "Unclustered" bucket instead of hiding it.
- **4.3 [FIX] Synthesis:** Send 5-10 samples per cluster (nearest to medoid plus a few spread across the cluster) with cluster size and gap mix. Do not rely on a single medoid.
- **4.4 [FIX] Verifier:** (a) Quotes must be exact substrings of the **sanitized** text. (b) All counts, percentages and rankings are computed in code and injected; LLM output containing numbers is checked against them. (c) Failures trigger one retry, then the field is dropped.
- **4.5 [FIX] Recency:** Store review date and app version. Show per-cluster date range and recent-share so fixed problems are not reported as current.

**Exit criteria:** Same input and seed give the same clusters. Verifier passes on all stored insights.

