**Goal:** Dashboard that surfaces insights honestly and stays fast. Visual design tokens (dark slate palette, teal-to-violet accent, Inter, 4px spacing, 12px card radius) are unchanged from v1 unless noted.

- **6.1 Setup:** Vite + React + Recharts + Lucide; static build deployed on Vercel. **[FIX]** API base URL comes from `VITE_API_BASE_URL` (a public value, baked in at build time, so redeploy after changing it). Add `vercel.json` with a rewrite to `index.html` if using client-side routing. Tokens as CSS custom properties.
- **6.2 Layout shell:** Sticky header with status dot driven by `/api/pipeline/status`; source badges with exact counts; responsive grid (2-col desktop, single column below 768px).
- **6.3 Components:**
  - **Metrics bar:** Total, yield %, relevant reviews, clusters. Count-up animation.
  - **Failure Distribution [FIX]:** Horizontal bars for the 5 gaps, toggle % vs. mentions, click filters the table. Include secondary-gap counts as a lighter overlay. Label it clearly as a distribution, not a drop-off funnel.
  - **Top 5 issues:** Rank, title, category, impact bar, expandable root cause / quotes / recommendation.
  - **Cluster explorer:** Cards with label, size, dominant gap, medoid quote, plus an "Unclustered" card. Drilldown modal with the insight and evidence quotes.
  - **VoC table:** Sticky header, filters, debounced search, pagination, empty state.
  - **Pipeline panel:** Run button, stage progress from the status endpoint, last run time.
  - **Copilot [FIX]:** Suggestion chips written for Google Photos retrieval (e.g. "Top search failures", "Can't find old photos", "Wrong results for a query"). Remove the fit/sizing and wishlist chips carried over from the earlier project. Show citations and an "insufficient data" reply when applicable.
- **6.4 Motion and performance [FIX]:** Use `backdrop-filter` sparingly (header and modal only), respect `prefers-reduced-motion`, skeleton loaders. Measure Lighthouse on a mid-range mobile profile early; if the targets (Performance >= 90, Accessibility >= 95) conflict with the glass effect, drop the effect.
- **6.5 Responsive and a11y:** Breakpoints 1280 / 768; 44px touch targets; table becomes cards on mobile; keyboard-navigable modal with focus trap; colors paired with text so gap badges are not color-only.

